[00:09.78]1. Great God, Jehovah, boundless in might,
[00:19.56]You have made known your love of right.
[00:29.34]Badness prevails on earth below,
[00:39.12]Causing us pain, as you well know.
[00:46.93]You are not slow, as men may contend;
[00:54.75]Your time is near for patience to end.
[01:02.56](Chorus)
[01:10.38]We look ahead with hope renewed,
[01:18.20]Praising your name in deep gratitude.
[01:26.01]2. One thousand years, from your point of view,
[01:31.77]Are like a day when they are through.
[01:38.49]Time now proceeds to your great day;
[01:46.17]It will arrive without delay.
[01:52.67]Though all transgression you do resent,
[01:59.16]Your heart is glad when sinners repent.
[02:02.60](Chorus)
[02:06.04]We look ahead with hope renewed,
[02:12.88]Praising your name in deep gratitude.